#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:7
msgid "Contributing to the QET source code"
msgstr "为 QET 源代码做贡献"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:9
msgid ""
"The goal of this page is to teach you basics about the QET source code and "
"how to contribute effectively to the project."
msgstr "本页旨在介绍 QET 源代码的基础知识，以及如何有效地为项目做贡献。"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:12
msgid "Access the source code"
msgstr "获取源代码"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:14
msgid ""
"To contribute to QElectroTech (QET), you need to have access to the `source "
"code`_."
msgstr "要为 QElectroTech（QET）做贡献，你需要能够访问 `源代码 <source code_>`_。"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:16
msgid "Source control is provided by `Git`_."
msgstr "源代码管理使用 `Git <Git_>`_。"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:18
msgid ""
"If you need help to setup or use Git, please take a look at the `Git "
"Documentation`_."
msgstr "如果你在配置或使用 Git 时需要帮助，请参阅 `Git 文档 <Git Documentation_>`_。"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:21
msgid "Access the code documentation"
msgstr "获取代码文档"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:23
msgid ""
"To better understand the QET code base, you can read the `code "
"documentation`_ generated by `doxygen`_."
msgstr ""
"要更好地理解 QET 代码库，可以阅读由 `doxygen <doxygen_>`_ 生成的 `代码文档 <code "
"documentation_>`_。"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:25
msgid ""
"This documentation is kept up-to-date by an action running on the upstream "
"repository. If you however want to generate and read it locally, `clone`_ it"
" and run the command :code:`doxygen Doxyfile` at the root of the created "
"directory."
msgstr ""
"该文档由运行在上游仓库上的 GitHub Action 保持更新。如果你希望在本地生成并阅读，请 `克隆 <clone_>`_ "
"该仓库，并在所创建目录的根目录下运行 :code:`doxygen Doxyfile` 命令。"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:28
msgid "Compile the app from source"
msgstr "从源代码编译应用程序"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:30
msgid ""
"To set up a dev environment and compile the app locally, please refer to the"
" :doc:`Build Guidelines<build>`."
msgstr "如需搭建开发环境并在本地编译应用，请参阅 :doc:`构建指南 <build>`。"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:33
msgid "Submit code"
msgstr "提交代码"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:35
msgid ""
"To add your additions to the QET codebase, you need to open a `Merge "
"Request`_ in the `source code`_ Git repository. This section will teach you "
"the syntax used in the project and some basic guidelines when contributing."
msgstr ""
"要将你的改动加入 QET 代码库，需要在 `源代码 <source code_>`_ Git 仓库中创建一个 `合并请求 <Merge "
"Request_>`_。本节将介绍项目中使用的语法以及贡献时的基本规范。"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:38
msgid "Coding Style Setup"
msgstr "代码风格设置"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:41
msgid "Make sure to follow the QET Coding style before submitting code."
msgstr "提交代码前，请务必遵循 QET 的代码风格。"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:44
msgid ""
"First you'll want to download the corresponding :download:`XML file "
"<../_external/_snippets/qtcreator-qet-style.xml>`."
msgstr ""
"首先，下载对应的 :download:`XML 文件 <../_external/_snippets/qtcreator-qet-"
"style.xml>`。"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:46
msgid ""
"Second, you'll need to import it into the QT Creator IDE. To do this, follow"
" those steps:"
msgstr "其次，将其导入 Qt Creator IDE。请按以下步骤操作："

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:48
msgid "Go to the \"Project\" tab and click on the \"Code Style\" element in the list."
msgstr "进入“Project”标签页，点击列表中的“Code Style”项。"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:52
msgid "Click on the \"Import\" button and select the XML file."
msgstr "点击“Import”按钮并选择该 XML 文件。"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:56
msgid "Select the \"QET\" Code Style in the dropdown"
msgstr "在下拉列表中选择“QET”代码风格"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:64
msgid "Do & Don't of contributing"
msgstr "贡献时的注意事项"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:70
msgid "Do"
msgstr "推荐做法"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:71
msgid "Don't"
msgstr "应避免的做法"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:72
msgid ""
"After forking the repository, please **create another branch** for your "
"changes. This will allow you to go back if something in the code breaks."
msgstr "派生仓库后，请为你的改动 **新建一个分支**。这样一旦代码出现问题，你可以轻松回退。"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:73
msgid ""
"Don't use :code:`git pull` when updating your MR, prefer :code:`git rebase`."
" This will apply all the latest changes and make the commit history more "
"readable, facilitating testing."
msgstr ""
"更新 MR 时不要使用 :code:`git pull`，而应优先使用 :code:`git "
"rebase`。这样会应用所有最新改动，并使提交历史更易读，便于测试。"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:74
msgid ""
"Structure your files so later contributors can easily make changes and "
"additions to your files"
msgstr "合理组织文件结构，以便后续贡献者能轻松修改和补充你的文件"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:75
msgid ""
"Don't submit `spaghetti code`_. Unmaintainable code is a burden for users, "
"maintainers and future developers."
msgstr "不要提交 `面条式代码 <spaghetti code_>`_。难以维护的代码会给用户、维护者和未来的开发者带来负担。"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:76
msgid ""
"Always add function descriptions for `doxygen`_. This allows documentation "
"to be updated when you push your additions"
msgstr "请始终为 `doxygen <doxygen_>`_ 添加函数说明。这样在你推送改动时，文档就能随之更新。"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:77
msgid ""
"Do not submit undocumented code. It makes it tough for maintainers and "
"future contributors to keep track of your features."
msgstr "不要提交没有文档的代码。否则维护者和未来的贡献者将难以跟踪你实现的功能。"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:81
msgid "Get Help"
msgstr "获取帮助"

#: ../../source/developer/contributing.rst:83
msgid ""
"If you need help regarding building, compiling the app or more insight in "
"the codebase, you can ask help on the `QET Forum`_."
msgstr "如果你在构建、编译应用或深入了解代码库方面需要帮助，可以在 `QET 论坛 <QET Forum_>`_ 上求助。"
